# A4 (problem catalogue 2026-11-07): the files below decide what Purix lets an agent do, so a change to them should need a
# named reviewer. Last matching pattern wins.
#
# The owner is the purix-pure account, as given by the project owner on 2026-11-13. If GitHub reports an owner here as
# invalid (an owner must be a user or an organisation team, such as @purix-pure/maintainers), replace the name on every rule
# below with the owner's own username or a team; until it is valid GitHub ignores the rule.
#
# Then turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection rule for main.

/packages/core/src/hooks/          @purix-pure
/packages/core/src/sandbox/        @purix-pure
/packages/core/src/gates/          @purix-pure
/packages/core/src/security/       @purix-pure
/packages/core/src/platform/       @purix-pure
/packages/core/package.json        @purix-pure
/.github/                          @purix-pure
/Dockerfile                        @purix-pure
/scripts/                          @purix-pure
/docs/claims.json                  @purix-pure
